# Local Bronze/Silver/Gold data lake root. This environment has no real
# MinIO/S3 available (see Phase 2, ADR-016), so transformations read and
# write Parquet under data/ on the local filesystem instead of a bucket.
# Generated, never committed -- same convention as pg_data/ and
# sample_data/generated/ above.
data/
